# Lesson 31.4 - step 2 of 2: GIAO NMR shieldings of acetone at B3LYP/pcSseg-1 on the r2SCAN-3c geometry.
# Run 04_acetone_opt.inp first. ORCA 6.1.1:  orca 04_acetone_nmr.inp > 04_acetone_nmr.out   (a few minutes)
